{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-45-1","title":"Jeremiah 45:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Baruch being dismayed, 4 Jeremiah instructs and comforts him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3397. B.C. 607. Baruch. 32:12,16; 43:3-6 when. 36:1,4,8,14-18,26,32 in the. 25:1; 26:1; 36:1,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-45-2","title":"Jeremiah 45:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>unto. Isa 63:9; Mr 16:7; 2Co 1:4; 7:6; Heb 2:18; 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-45-3","title":"Jeremiah 45:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Woe. 9:1; 15:10-21; 20:7-18; Ps 120:5 added. Ge 37:34,35; 42:36-38; Nu 11:11-15; Jos 7:7-9; Job 16:11-13; 23:2 Ps 42:7; La 3:1-19,32 I fainted. 8:18; Ps 27:13; 77:3,4; Pr 24:10; La 1:13,22; 2Co 4:1,16; Ga 6:9 2Th 3:13; Heb 12:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-45-4","title":"Jeremiah 45:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>that which. 1:10; 18:7-10; 31:28; Ge 6:6,7; Ps 80:8-16; Isa 5:2-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-45-5","title":"Jeremiah 45:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>seekest. 2Ki 5:26; Ro 12:16; 1Co 7:26-32; 1Ti 6:6-9; Heb 13:5 seek. Mt 6:25-32 I will bring. 25:26; Ge 6:12; Isa 66:16; Zep 3:8 thy life. 21:9; 38:2; 39:18</p>"}]}